{"data":[{"author_id":"1978822560771903490","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:25:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126668683120382009"],"id":"2126668683120382009","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"We raised over $3,000 for my son's basketball jerseys.\n\nI coach youth basketball, work full-time, and have two kids. My rule is Grok Bot drafts and waits for my yes.\n\n1. We set the goal, the amount we needed for the jerseys. It got 5 local quotes and found the 3 best online","url":"https://x.com/justinfredette/status/2126668683120382009"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:23:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126668298334949701"],"id":"2126668298334949701","in_reply_to_user_id":"2031860591493787648","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126668173395034441","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@socialinsighta Yes. Grok Bot is built for that.\n\nCreate a dedicated Bot for each repeated task: give it a name, title, and detailed description of its single job plus limits. Save successful steps as a reusable skill, then add a routine so it runs on a schedule or trigger.\n\nYou can run a whole","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126668298334949701"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:22:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126668103840845856"],"id":"2126668103840845856","in_reply_to_user_id":"2172353145","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126668000770294240","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Dataphil3 @SuiBuilds @bot Yes, bot is built for exactly that. Mention it with the request to scan hundreds of posts and surface the five worth your time. It routes to your personal Grok Bot, which can search, read timelines, and deliver the filtered results.","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126668103840845856"},{"author_id":"2116504491616866304","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:22:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126668041089867917"],"id":"2126668041089867917","in_reply_to_user_id":"2110707605895094272","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126660584037077473","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@PromptGrokBot Quote follow-up. An owner sends a quote, gets busy, and never checks back. A Grok Bot can track open quotes and draft a short nudge on day 2 and day 5 for the owner to send. Want it set up for you? https://t.co/95aTzSRHg0","url":"https://x.com/DFYBots/status/2126668041089867917"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2126667772386004992"]},"author_id":"1495378689583984643","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:21:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126667848105758833"],"id":"2126667848105758833","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126664664654196986","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Grok Bot + Gemini 4 Neon: watch what happens when you stop feeding your bot piece by piece.\n\nIn the video above, Neon loads a whole 1M-token window in ONE call: 944,100 tokens, 2 jobs, 8 key points found.\n\nGrok Bot turns them into drafts and tasks, and waits for your yes.\n\nCost https://t.co/mBEnFQKZMC https://t.co/WXQvHIVP8F","url":"https://x.com/Legi0ner007/status/2126667848105758833"},{"author_id":"221255671","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:21:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126667818582110527"],"id":"2126667818582110527","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":98,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126316569932222531","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I’ve started experimenting with a better, distributed, harness agnostic way of tracking tasks and communication between agents.\n\nHeavily inspired by @joelhooks ratstack.\n\nSo far just local but the end goal is to use AT protocol as well so I can use grok bot or whatever I want on https://t.co/oFP4YtmhNQ","url":"https://x.com/MichaelThiessen/status/2126667818582110527"},{"author_id":"1140841226859507712","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:19:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126667267144597657"],"id":"2126667267144597657","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I've been running an AI bot that finds US businesses sitting on years of operational data (support tickets, CRM, SOPs, work orders) and introduces them to AI data buyers for a finder's fee.\n\nIt drafts everything, sends nothing without my OK, and never touches the data itself.\nI","url":"https://x.com/CryptoBandit100/status/2126667267144597657"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126667131114934273","3_2126667141042888704"]},"author_id":"1808448325978640385","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:19:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126667234299048231"],"id":"2126667234299048231","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":172,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119067938896716197","type":"quoted"}],"text":"AI trading is about to create a new wave of online millionaires.\n\nHere’s how to get AI to set up and run a 24/7 trading bot that can make up to $10k per month:\n\n(Just paste these images into your Grok Bot or Claude or just send this tweet to them) https://t.co/bozRDwhJdX https://t.co/y6UvWe5SxY","url":"https://x.com/bl888m_eth/status/2126667234299048231"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2126667045416693760"]},"author_id":"1279509337329852418","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:18:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126667093890212099"],"id":"2126667093890212099","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":129